RcppAMGCL copyright and bundled-code inventory
============================================

The RcppAMGCL wrapper and its R-independent C++ interface are copyright
2026 Santiago Hermo, under the MIT license identified in DESCRIPTION and
LICENSE. This does not replace the copyrights or licenses of bundled code.

AMGCL 1.4.5 is bundled in inst/include/amgcl (include/amgcl after
installation). Its origin, pinned revision and local patches are recorded
in inst/AMGCL-VERSION (AMGCL-VERSION after installation). All original
header notices are retained. The AMGCL MIT license is also installed as
licenses/AMGCL-LICENSE.md. Additional notices copied verbatim from the
headers are installed as licenses/AMGCL-THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.

Paths below are relative to include/amgcl. This inventory covers all
distributed headers, including components not used by the R interface.
The notices in the individual files remain authoritative; the package's
MIT designation does not remove their additional conditions.

